      "id": 488604,
      "username": "Lakshit_Jain",
      "name": "Lakshit Jain",
      "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:39:18.153Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Item Tax Template is used to determine mine the rate for taxes specified in the Transaction.</p>\n<p>So in a transaction, if the  item tax template is specified and the tax account specified in the transaction is in the Item Tax Template, then the rate will be used from the Item Tax Template; else it will be used from the tax row.</p>\n<p>The India Compliance app already provides default templates.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://docs.indiacompliance.app/assets/gst_item_tax_template.BP3NrURS.png\" alt=\"GST Item Tax Template\" width=\"690\" height=\"474\"></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/9/e956055cd1962853693d661cedde97427a923759.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e956055cd1962853693d661cedde97427a923759\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/9/e956055cd1962853693d661cedde97427a923759_2_690x201.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"xiby4PJW8lE0rwZT56LWl7rrfER\" width=\"690\" height=\"201\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/9/e956055cd1962853693d661cedde97427a923759_2_690x201.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/9/e956055cd1962853693d661cedde97427a923759.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/9/e956055cd1962853693d661cedde97427a923759.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">896×262 16.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
